@Helpdesk.Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5087

### Health check
GET {{Helpdesk.Web_HostAddress}}/healthz
Accept: application/json

### Chat: knowledge-base question (grounded via File Search, e.g. HR leave policy)
POST {{Helpdesk.Web_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "test-session-1",
  "message": "How many vacation days do I get?"
}

### Chat: tool call - check status of the seeded ticket
POST {{Helpdesk.Web_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "test-session-1",
  "message": "What's the status of ticket #123?"
}

### Chat: tool call - create a new ticket
POST {{Helpdesk.Web_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "test-session-1",
  "message": "Reset my laptop password, please open a ticket for alice."
}

### Chat: knowledge-base question (IT password reset policy)
POST {{Helpdesk.Web_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "test-session-2",
  "message": "What's the process for requesting new hardware?"
}

### Chat: invalid request - missing sessionId -> 400
POST {{Helpdesk.Web_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "",
  "message": "Hello"
}

### Chat: invalid request - empty message -> 400
POST {{Helpdesk.Web_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "test-session-1",
  "message": ""
}

### Chat: rate limit test - send this request 11+ times within a minute to trigger 429
POST {{Helpdesk.Web_HostAddress}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "rate-limit-test",
  "message": "Hi"
}

###
